{
  "name": "task_lifecycle",
  "description": "Generic tasks default to queue tasks and payload {}; a repeated idempotency key replays the same event; CancelTask skips a pending task and replays the terminal event; a timer FIRE cannot be cancelled with CancelTask; a leased task cannot be cancelled because an executor may already run it.",
